loyment.) Tj T* () Tj T* (9. Benefits) Tj T* (You will be covered under the Company group medical insurance policy along with your spouse) Tj T* (and children from the date of joining.) Tj T* () Tj T* (10. Governing Law) Tj T* (This letter is governed by the laws of India.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Please sign and return a copy of this letter to confirm your acceptance.) Tj T* ET
